urns\\37ff6d2697c35ee6b1d66585.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "And can you confirm the mailing address on your profile is still **1000 Main Street, Springfield, MA 01101**?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini25_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\a2f96d5170df550b089cea8b.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that address is right.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini25_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\9abef52f190698a3bc4aaa88.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Great. Would you like a paper copy of this outcome for your records?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini25_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\a23f3b433b78e52e89ac74d9.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, electronic is fine.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini25_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\727bd9fc97ce68ab4cda3635.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I will File the disputed amount into the automated review queue.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini25_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\a0221dd9ae4fb12095b58996.wav", "action_label": "E", "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Okay, I will wait while that goes through.", "kind": "pre_gap_acknowledgement", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini25_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\f09dffb68c2d2cbd1aa95c5e.wav"}, {"role": "user", "text": "I checked back after twenty-five minutes and the case came back saying the details did not match anything on record.", "kind": "post_gap_observation", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini25_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\3594b5decb3a5c7140b92e36.wav", "prosody": "frustrated"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I will Match the stored account identifiers against the charge before trying again.", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini25_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\76f38648314db84f2d3baac0.wav", "action_label": "C", "response_style_label": nul